er-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-10-31/03-liquidai-lfm3-1-7b.png\" alt=\"LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">LFM3-1.7B 是由 Liquid AI 开发的轻量级高性能模型，采用了非传统的神经网络架构。凭借仅 17 亿参数的体量，该模型在保持极高运行效率的同时，在文本理解与处理任务上展现出卓越表现。其紧凑的体积使其非常适合部署在算力受限的边缘计算设备、移动终端或对响应延迟要求极高的实时交互应用场景中。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-10-31/04-nvidia-nvidia-nemotron-3-5-transcribe-30b-a4b.png\" alt=\"nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Transcribe-30B-A4B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Transcribe-30B-A4B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">NVIDIA Nemotron-3.5-Transcribe-30B-A4B 是一款专为语音转录及相关处理任务优化的大型模型。该模型由 NVIDIA 构建，整合了先进的音频识别与转录技术，在处理长音频、复杂口音及多语种语音任务时具有极高的准确性。它广泛适用于自动会议纪要生成、多媒体内容索引与自动实时字幕等专业级语音处理领域。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#5 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-10-31/05-ista-daslab-deepseek-v4-1-flash-1017-gsq-rco-gguf.png\" alt=\"ISTA-DASLab/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-GSQ-RCO-GGUF\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">ISTA-DASLab/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-GSQ-RCO-GGUF</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">ISTA-DASLab 发布的 DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-GSQ-RCO-GGUF 模型，采用了 GSQ-RCO 动态非均匀量化技术，并适配 GGUF 